     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\nAnybody for screwworms ?\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<b>Von:</b> Miller, Ryan - MRP-APHIS &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ryan.s...@usda.gov</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Gesendet:</b> Donnerstag, 5. November 2026 21:56<br>\r\n<b>Cc:</b> Portacci, Katie - MRP-APHIS &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">katie.p...@usda.gov</a>&gt;; Musgrave, Karl - MRP-APHIS &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Karl.M...@usda.gov</a>&gt;; Rojas-Walker, Magaly - MRP-APHIS &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">magaly.ro...@usda.gov</a>&gt;; Padda, Hannah - MRP-APHIS &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Hannah...@usda.gov</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Betreff:</b> Fellowship in New World Screwworm Modeling and Surveillance (Closes End Nov 2026)</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Colleagues,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">We are seeking three quantitative ecologists with modeling experience (mathematical/Bayesian) and interest in applying models to provide practical guidance\r\n for New World Screwworm surveillance, especially in wildlife.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">We are reviewing candidates as they apply and hope to have people on board this before the end of the year. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt\">Please distribute.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><b>Apply here -&gt;</b></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt\"><b>\r\n</b></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(5,99,193)\"><a href=\"https://www.zintellect.com/Opportunity/Details/USDA-APHIS-2026-0421\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.zintellect.com/Opportunity/Details/USDA-APHIS-2026-0421&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1794124068861000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3dfj7nCRDhE-X0zwORnJj5\"><b><u>https://www.zintellect.com/Opportunity/Details/USDA-APHIS-2026-0421</u></b></a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;color:black;background-color:rgb(252,252,252)\">Ryan S. Miller,\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10pt;color:black;background-color:rgb(252,252,252)\">PhD</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(11,36,55)\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;color:rgb(59,56,56);background-color:rgb(252,252,252)\">Senior Ecologist</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;color:rgb(11,36,55);background-color:rgb(252,252,252)\"><br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;color:rgb(59,56,56);background-color:rgb(252,252,252)\">Center for Epidemiology and Animal Health | Veterinary Services</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;color:rgb(11,36,55);background-color:rgb(252,252,252)\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;color:black;background-color:rgb(252,252,252)\"><img style=\"width:2.9583in;min-height:0.3437in;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" width=\"283\" height=\"32\" size=\"8345\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/hmecology/attach/5e14738ecc9f8/image001.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;color:black;background-color:rgb(252,252,252)\">Animal and Plant Health Inspection\r\n Service</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:9pt\">2150 Centre Ave., Bldg. B,  Fort Collins, CO 80526</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Aptos&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:9pt;color:black;background-color:rgb(252,252,252)\">c: <a href=\"tel:(970)%20215-2055\" value=\"+19702152055\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(970) 215-2055</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot